		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>10-foot-tall, animated statue shaped like a gold, scepter- wielding noble. Turns to worthless slag if destroyed.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 54, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +6 (2d8) or prismatic ray, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Golem</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to damage from cold, fire, or non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Prismatic Ray</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) of rainbow energy extending near from golem, CHA 15+ or suffer random effect (d4): 1. Blind 1d4 rounds, 2. Stunned 1d4 rounds, 3. Insane for 1d4 rounds, 4. 3d10 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
